<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners sell 267.90 mln rand S.Africa bonds Fri.</title>
<headline>Foreigners sell 267.90 mln rand S.Africa bonds Fri.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net sellers of 267.90 million rand's worth of South African bonds on Friday after buying 39.04 million rand's worth on Thursday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
